sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant O as Registry owner EOA
  participant R as Policy Registry
  participant T as Teleport caller contract
  participant X as DEX manager or router
  O->>R: Call an owner-only policy setter
  R->>R: Increment version and record policy hash
  T->>R: Read executor and asset flags and pause state
  alt Guard fails or Registry is paused
    R-->>T: Revert or false policy result
    T-->>O: Operation is rejected
  else Guards pass
    R-->>T: Policy flags accepted
    T->>X: Execute one-transaction liquidity operation
    X-->>T: Return result or revert
  end
